    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As the First Language encompasses all things, truenamers are wont to learn other, simpler languages in an effort to understand more of the universe. At 2nd level and every two levels beyond 2nd, the truenamer learns an additional language that is not designated as secret, like drow sign language or druidic.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/truenamer#toc14\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
